<view class="page">
  <view class="page-toolbar">
    <button class="guide-button" bindtap="openGuide" aria-label="使用说明">?</button>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-section">
    <text class="section-heading">麻将记分</text>
    <button class="action-button mahjong-button" bindtap="openMahjongCreate">创建房间</button>
    <button class="action-button secondary-action" bindtap="openMahjongJoin">加入房间</button>
  </view>

  <view class="entry-section poker-section">
    <text class="section-heading">扑克记账</text>
    <button class="action-button poker-button" bindtap="openPokerCreate">创建账本</button>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showMahjongCreate}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeMahjongCreate">
  <view class="action-sheet" catchtap="preventSheetClose">
    <text class="sheet-title">创建房间</text>
    <input value="{{mahjongRoomCode}}" bindinput="onMahjongRoomCodeInput" placeholder="房间码（选填，留空自动生成）" class="sheet-input code-input" maxlength="50" />
    <view class="sheet-actions">
      <button class="sheet-cancel" bindtap="closeMahjongCreate">取消</button>
      <button class="sheet-confirm mahjong-button" loading="{{creatingMahjong}}" bindtap="createMahjongRoom">创建房间</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showMahjongJoin}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeMahjongJoin">
  <view class="action-sheet" catchtap="preventSheetClose">
    <text class="sheet-title">加入房间</text>
    <input value="{{mahjongJoinCode}}" bindinput="onMahjongJoinCodeInput" placeholder="输入房间码" class="input code-input" maxlength="50" />
    <view class="sheet-actions">
      <button class="sheet-cancel" bindtap="closeMahjongJoin">取消</button>
      <button class="sheet-confirm mahjong-button" loading="{{joiningMahjong}}" bindtap="joinMahjongRoom">加入房间</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showPokerCreate}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closePokerCreate">
  <view class="action-sheet" catchtap="preventSheetClose">
    <text class="sheet-title">创建账本</text>
    <input value="{{pokerLedgerName}}" bindinput="onPokerLedgerNameInput" placeholder="账本名称" class="sheet-input" maxlength="50" />
    <view class="sheet-actions">
      <button class="sheet-cancel" bindtap="closePokerCreate">取消</button>
      <button class="sheet-confirm poker-button" loading="{{creatingPoker}}" bindtap="createPokerLedger">创建账本</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{guideOpen}}" class="guide-mask" bindtap="closeGuide">
  <view class="guide-modal" catchtap="preventGuideClose">
    <view class="guide-header">
      <text class="guide-dialog-title">使用说明</text>
      <button class="guide-close" bindtap="closeGuide" aria-label="关闭使用说明">×</button>
    </view>
    <scroll-view class="guide-body" scroll-y>
      <view class="guide-section">
        <text class="guide-section-title">麻将</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>进入房间即成为成员，点头像可互相转账；茶水费为虚拟账户。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>房主可在普通、坐下模式间切换；坐下模式需四家入座，切换时按提示入座或离座。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>转错账只能冲正自己付款的记录；30 分钟无转账会自动解散，账目仍会归档。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>退出只离开本局，可再次进入，历史余额会自动接上。</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="guide-section">
        <text class="guide-section-title">德州</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>账本是创建者个人使用的记账本，不与他人协作。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet">·</text><text>记录玩家买入和结余即可自动计算净盈亏；历史可查看日期、人数和明细。</text></view>
      </view>

      <view class="guide-section guide-section-last">
        <text class="guide-section-title guide-section-title-common">通用</text>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>麻将房数据保存在云端，成员实时同步；更换设备后使用同一微信即可同步。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>历史房间、账本和个人战绩可在“我的”查看。</text></view>
        <view class="guide-item"><text class="guide-bullet guide-bullet-common">·</text><text>牌局明细保留 6 个月；超过后会清理明细，但清理前会保存汇总快照，历史总输赢不会受影响。</text></view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>
</view>
